Subject: [PATCH] Preserve original native matrix inverse destination semantics

Upstream-base: c7b2e663f878d38dc429ab12ee7db451daf0c217
Prepared-preimage: strict-complete-candidate after reviewed 192-patch series

Confine the inherited singular-matrix exception and temporary destination to
explicit DIAGNOSTIC_MATRICES. The normal original whole platvmath TU retains
its direct C_MTX44Inverse call, ignored return result, partial destination
writes and alias behavior. No extraction or game-side algorithm change.

diff --git a/src/NL/plat/platvmath.cpp b/src/NL/plat/platvmath.cpp
--- a/src/NL/plat/platvmath.cpp
+++ b/src/NL/plat/platvmath.cpp
@@ -29,7 +29,7 @@
 
 nlMatrix4& nlInvertMatrix(nlMatrix4& out, const nlMatrix4& in)
 {
-#if defined(MSCHARGED_NATIVE)
+#if defined(MSCHARGED_NATIVE) && defined(MSCHARGED_DIAGNOSTIC_MATRICES)
     nlMatrix4 inverse;
     if (!C_MTX44Inverse(in.e2, inverse.e2))
         throw std::invalid_argument("Cannot invert a singular matrix");
